/v1/","context":{"app_id":2988160,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2988160","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:33:58Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5101650","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1846651706684405","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest, First Licensed Killer and more!","summary":"NEXT FEST PLAYTESTWe're happy to announce that the game will be playable for a full week during Next Fest, starting Monday!Head over to the store page and download the demo. Matchmaking will go live at the start of the event.FIRST LICENSED KILLER The first licensed killer will be arriving soon. We can't reveal who it is yet, but hopefully it's the first of many.'PLAY AS YOU WAIT' MATCHMAKINGKiller players can now reserve a spot in the matchmaking queue, play a Resident match or do something else","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:50:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1840310314351415","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"News & Incoming Playtest","summary":"The next Playtest begins this Friday, August 14 and is going to run for at least 3 days:August 14 & 15 - Founders onlyAugust 16 - Public, open to everyone!If you'd like to participate, go ahead and Request Access from the Store Page if you haven't already!What will we be testing?THE DEMON VARIANTFor the first time we'll be going against and playing as a fully flying killer! It will be exciting to see what you can do with it. It's uncharted territory in asyms in general so let's be patient and tr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T12:32:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351415","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1836506165578647","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"Flying Killer Lands in FTR!","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T17:36:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578647","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1826362059930707","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"JUDGMENT HOUR","summary":"WHAT IS JUDGMENT HOUR?It's a global event system and we decide when the event happens. Through our actions we influence how close we are to reaching it. We can see in the main menu at all times how close we are. It can be affected by many player actions and behaviors in-game. We can get closer, or further, depending on how we play. WHAT HAPPENS IF WE TRIGGER IT? A special Reaper called The Adjudicator becomes playable, only for an hour. If a player selects the Adjudicator, Residents will face hi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T16:19:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059930707","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1826362059927222","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"Public Playtest and What's New!","summary":"Hello!The next playtest will take place from March 27th until March 31st!It's a public test, anyone can participate so spread the word!If you took part in our last public test you're good to go, all you need to do is re-install the Fear The Reaper Playtest app on Steam. If you haven't gotten access yet, you can go to the game's store page and click the REQUEST ACCESS button. New requests will be granted a little closer to the test, so worry not, you will get in!You can log into the game now and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-07T18:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059927222","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1811772772452476","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"Halloween Public Playtest!","summary":"ARE YOU BUSY THIS HALLOWEEN?If not, come face The Reaper and scream with us!I'm happy to announce our first public Playtest. It will start on Halloween night October 31st and the game will be playable until November 4th.To request access to the Playtest go to the game's Store page and click the \"Request Access\" button. Then wait. Spots will be limited but I plan on letting a healthy amount of folks in. With every future Playtest we will expand the pool. Founders and Content Creators need not do ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-01T19:46:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1811772772452476","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1803527891899875","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"Fear The Reaper Beta Phase Begins Now!","summary":"I'm happy to announce that we're officially entering BETA PHASE. From now on, we will be regularly testing the game with the community, with the goal of improving it and making sure that it's as balanced as it can be and the technical quality is up to a high standard. As we go, each beta test will open up to more and more players, culminating in at least one big open test. But to get there, I will need your help. Let's try and make a game we can all enjoy for years to come. This step is about ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-08T15:36:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891899875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2988160-1798454487648142","game_id":"steam-2988160","kind":"announcement","title":"Fear The Reaper Founder's Pack","summary":"Join our Discord for more information! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45459663/c166502ff19e963589c3c2ebda7e2b670ed309be.png","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-02T21:15:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1798454487648142","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2988160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2988160":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2988160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5101650":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:21:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2988160","app_id":2988160,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":